<%- include('partials/header',{title:'Sources and methodology'}) %><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">TRANSPARENCY</span><h1>Sources matter.<br><em>So do limitations.</em></h1><p>The goal is to help visitors inspect evidence, not tell them how to vote or predict who will win.</p></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container"><h2>Editorial principles</h2><div class="row g-3 mb-5"><% [['Separate facts from claims','Label official statistics, government announcements, media reporting, poll findings and opinion separately.'],['Show dates and methods','Include fieldwork dates, sample, question wording, interview mode and uncertainty where published.'],['No winner score','This site does not calculate candidate electability, winner probability or a political performance score.'],['Correct and update','Keep an update log and link corrections to original sources.']].forEach(x=>{ %><div class="col-md-6"><div class="question-card"><h3><%= x[0] %></h3><p><%= x[1] %></p></div></div><% }) %></div><h2>Starter source list</h2><% sources.forEach(s=>{ %><div class="source-row"><div><h3><%= s.name %></h3><p><%= s.purpose %></p></div><a href="<%= s.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit source ↗</a></div><% }) %><div class="notice mt-4"><strong>Data status:</strong> This project contains a dated sample dataset reviewed on 13 October 2026. It is not automatically updated. Verify figures against original sources before publishing. Never label a voluntary web survey as a nationally representative poll.</div><h2 class="mt-5">Improve research quality</h2><ol class="method-list"><li>Use primary sources such as KNBS, CBK, National Treasury, Controller of Budget, Auditor-General, IEBC and original pollster releases.</li><li>Track what was promised, budgeted, spent, delivered and independently verified.</li><li>Publish survey sample design, recruitment method, dates, question wording, size and limitations.</li><li>Do not combine social-media comments and scientific polls as if they measure the same population.</li><li>Protect respondents' privacy and comply with applicable Kenyan data-protection requirements.</li></ol></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>
